          "name": "Check if a staker has an active delegation by the staker BTC address (Taproot or Native Segwit).\nOptionally, you can provide a timeframe to check if the delegation is active within the provided timeframe\nThe available timeframe is \"today\" which checks after UTC 12AM of the current day",
          "request": {
